WEBVTT

00:20.200 --> 00:23.370
I can't... anymore...

00:23.370 --> 00:26.160
Not enough Shut-in-ium!

00:26.160 --> 00:27.580
Yeah...

00:27.580 --> 00:28.490
Mary!

00:28.490 --> 00:29.290
Hang in there!

00:29.290 --> 00:30.790
Your wound's not that deep!

00:30.790 --> 00:33.450
You can do it! I think we're almost there!

00:33.450 --> 00:35.250
So if you just...

00:35.250 --> 00:37.620
How can I possibly go on?

00:37.620 --> 00:38.660
Huh?!

00:38.660 --> 00:42.700
Champe, you can't just force support on people.

00:42.700 --> 00:44.540
Okay.

00:44.540 --> 00:47.660
Good news, Mary! Ratura said she'd carry you!

00:47.660 --> 00:49.500
What gave you that idea?!

00:50.340 --> 00:55.670
I kept drawing rainbow colours over and over

00:50.340 --> 00:55.670
hitasura kaiteta niji no iro

00:55.670 --> 01:00.170
Seven colours are not enough

00:55.670 --> 01:00.170
mou nanairo ja tarinai kara

01:00.170 --> 01:05.840
Everyday leaps over the "usual" and enters a new chapter

01:00.170 --> 01:03.170
mainichi wa sude ni itsumo wo

01:03.170 --> 01:05.840
tobikoete shinshou nano sa

01:05.840 --> 01:11.840
The story is going beyond

01:05.840 --> 01:11.840
monogatari wa haruka kanata e

01:16.010 --> 01:21.340
The bell toll in my heart

01:16.010 --> 01:21.340
kokoro de naridasu kane no ne ga

01:21.340 --> 01:25.670
is getting louder bit by bit

01:21.340 --> 01:25.670
sukoshi zutsu ookiku natte yuku

01:25.670 --> 01:29.170
Believe in the excitement

01:25.670 --> 01:29.170
sono takanari wo shinjite

01:29.170 --> 01:31.670
And take one step forward

01:29.170 --> 01:31.670
ippo wo fumidaseta nara

01:31.670 --> 01:39.000
It'll give me more power than I ever imagined

01:31.670 --> 01:39.000
souzou ijouno chikara ni kawatteru yo

01:37.340 --> 01:40.000
Can't be for sure

01:37.340 --> 01:40.000
zettai nante nai

01:39.000 --> 01:41.670
Nothing

01:39.000 --> 01:41.670
nanimo

01:40.000 --> 01:42.670
There's no guarantee

01:40.000 --> 01:42.670
kakushin wa dekinai

01:41.670 --> 01:44.340
No one

01:41.670 --> 01:44.340
daremo

01:42.670 --> 01:45.340
But I won't give up

01:42.670 --> 01:45.340
demo akiramenai

01:44.340 --> 01:47.000
That's why

01:44.340 --> 01:47.000
dakara

01:45.340 --> 01:47.500
I can still move forward

01:45.340 --> 01:47.500
susundeku koto ga

01:47.330 --> 01:48.840
I can still move forward

01:47.330 --> 01:48.840
dekiru yo

01:48.840 --> 01:54.670
Because there's magic right in here

01:48.840 --> 01:54.670
koko ni wa mahou ga aru kara

01:54.670 --> 02:01.000
It started to be brighter than the stars

01:54.670 --> 02:01.000
datte hoshi yori kagayaki dashita no ni

02:01.000 --> 02:05.670
I can't stop now

02:01.000 --> 02:05.670
tachidomareru hazu mo nai kara

02:05.670 --> 02:11.340
It entered into a new era

02:05.670 --> 02:11.340
jidai wa tsui ni atarashii makuake wo mukaeta no sa

02:11.340 --> 02:15.670
Placing this overflowing feelings into this gem

02:11.340 --> 02:15.670
afureta omoi wo kiseki ni komete

02:15.670 --> 02:19.340
And go beyond the future

02:15.670 --> 02:19.340
saki no hou e

02:28.290 --> 02:31.080
Luci, it's about time to leave.

02:35.290 --> 02:36.910
Oh, that.

02:36.910 --> 02:38.620
I'm skipping.

02:38.620 --> 02:40.580
Wait, are you serious?

02:40.580 --> 02:43.370
I don't have that much free time on my hands.

02:43.370 --> 02:46.040
Not to mention, today's the day
I've been waiting for.

02:58.910 --> 03:00.330
I wonder what this is.

03:00.330 --> 03:04.540
Littering is bad. You get points
knocked off if you're caught.

03:04.540 --> 03:05.870
You actually sound convincing.

03:05.870 --> 03:06.820
What?!

03:06.820 --> 03:07.910
That wasn't a compliment.

03:07.910 --> 03:10.450
Eh?! This is a summons!

03:10.450 --> 03:11.620
What?

03:11.620 --> 03:13.200
What's that doing here?

03:13.200 --> 03:14.450
A summons?

03:14.450 --> 03:17.950
The academy assigns certain
assignments to specific groups.

03:17.950 --> 03:19.370
Then they send a summons.

03:19.370 --> 03:23.330
It's said they're assigned on
the director's whim and bias.

03:23.330 --> 03:28.200
The summons can be anything from aid,
disaster prevention, nurturing, and such.

03:28.200 --> 03:30.290
And that's assigned on that?

03:30.290 --> 03:31.950
"Survey the forest."

03:31.950 --> 03:35.830
This is a survey summons to
Lucifer-san and Angelica-san's group.

03:39.120 --> 03:41.330
Apparently, there's a part of the forest where

03:41.330 --> 03:44.660
travelers have encountered
supernatural phenomena.

03:44.660 --> 03:46.500
Supernatural phenomena?

03:46.500 --> 03:48.620
Some have reported hearing eerie singing voices

03:48.620 --> 03:51.040
as well as other mysterious events

03:51.040 --> 03:54.830
so it's saying to work together with
other groups to figure out what's going on.

03:54.830 --> 03:57.080
Anything about Magical Monsters?

03:57.080 --> 04:01.000
It appears that highly dangerous
Magical Monsters don't inhabit that area.

04:01.000 --> 04:05.040
Could we possibly get points
if we survey the forest, then?

04:05.040 --> 04:06.790
Of course!

04:06.790 --> 04:09.830
Though there aren't
too many who'd go for points.

04:09.830 --> 04:13.580
Being summoned is considered quite the honour.

04:13.580 --> 04:16.200
I wonder if we're allowed to help, too...

04:16.200 --> 04:20.870
That might prove difficult. The time everyone
was supposed to depart has passed

04:20.870 --> 04:23.500
and I'm not quite sure where to go.

04:23.500 --> 04:26.500
I guess that's out of the question, then.

04:28.410 --> 04:30.450
We've reached the area we are to survey.

04:31.290 --> 04:34.750
I guess we can set up camp here.

04:34.750 --> 04:39.330
Water, temperature, humidity, and safety.
I see no problem here.

04:39.330 --> 04:40.830
No arguments here!

04:40.830 --> 04:45.000
This is so rock! Survival of
the fittest in the wilderness!

04:45.000 --> 04:48.200
Being surrounded by my sisters
under the starry sky...

04:49.870 --> 04:54.330
I know of something far scarier than
any supernatural phenomena going on here.

04:54.330 --> 04:56.040
Are we here?

04:56.040 --> 04:58.000
We're gonna set up camp here!

04:58.000 --> 05:02.040
Good grief. Come on, Mary. We're here.

05:07.790 --> 05:10.200
That was a harsh journey.

05:10.200 --> 05:11.870
Seriously?

05:11.870 --> 05:14.450
If we split up the tent,
ingredients, and cooking duties,

05:14.450 --> 05:16.200
it'll cover all three groups.

05:16.200 --> 05:18.870
Then let's split up.

05:18.870 --> 05:21.330
Okay! I'll be in charge of eating!

05:21.330 --> 05:25.830
Salsa-sama, those who do not work
shall starve and die.

05:25.830 --> 05:27.160
Let's do a lottery.

05:27.160 --> 05:28.700
That sounds fun!

05:28.700 --> 05:31.580
I believe it's far more efficient
to split up in our usual groups.

05:31.580 --> 05:35.410
I thought this might be a good opportunity
for all of us to get closer.

05:35.410 --> 05:36.450
No way!

05:36.450 --> 05:38.660
What a wonderful idea!

05:38.660 --> 05:42.950
I couldn't possibly bear being
separated from my sisters!

05:42.950 --> 05:46.250
This might be your chance
to gain even more little sisters.

05:46.250 --> 05:48.580
Tsubaki Onee-chan.

05:50.370 --> 05:52.370
A lottery's a great idea!

05:59.700 --> 06:02.750
I've finally acquired the board game!

06:04.200 --> 06:07.080
Wait, wasn't that...

06:07.080 --> 06:08.580
Lucifer?!

06:10.830 --> 06:12.330
Wait, why are you here?

06:13.620 --> 06:16.040
Are you implying that
I'm not allowed to be here?

06:16.040 --> 06:18.250
Don't you have a summons?

06:18.250 --> 06:20.660
Oh, that.

06:20.660 --> 06:22.580
I don't have time for that.

06:22.580 --> 06:23.790
Is that okay?

06:23.790 --> 06:27.040
Then do you mind if we accept it instead?

06:27.040 --> 06:29.250
It's fine. Do as you please.

06:29.250 --> 06:31.910
I'm rather busy.

06:31.910 --> 06:32.950
Thanks!

06:32.950 --> 06:34.950
Do you know what area's supposed to be surveyed?

06:37.410 --> 06:38.910
Lucifer?

06:38.910 --> 06:40.910
There's a map.

06:40.910 --> 06:42.540
Then can we have it?

06:42.540 --> 06:45.660
It wouldn't be any fun
to just give it to you for free.

06:47.040 --> 06:48.910
I think we understand.

06:48.910 --> 06:51.500
Basically, we just have to win the game, right?

06:51.500 --> 06:54.120
Correct. We'll be tag-teaming this board game.

06:54.120 --> 06:56.500
You might end up dropping out, so be ready.

06:56.500 --> 06:59.410
It'll just be Angelica and I on our team.

06:59.410 --> 07:01.620
Oh, fine. I guess I'm in.

07:01.620 --> 07:04.330
If you win, I'll give you
the map for the summons.

07:04.330 --> 07:06.620
You guys don't need
any alternates or anything?

07:06.620 --> 07:09.450
Well, Rose's working right now...

07:09.450 --> 07:13.450
Like we'd drop out of a board game. How lame.

07:14.500 --> 07:17.790
I'll make sure you truly regret those words.

07:19.370 --> 07:22.330
All right, let's start. Let the games begin!

07:23.450 --> 07:24.540
Four.

07:26.950 --> 07:29.540
Have your partner act like a rabbit.

07:29.540 --> 07:31.370
Wait, am I the partner here?

07:33.160 --> 07:34.950
Huh? What is this?!

07:36.540 --> 07:38.370
Wait, why?

07:44.410 --> 07:47.540
This board game is magical.

07:47.540 --> 07:49.500
Its creator was rather eccentric.

07:54.120 --> 07:58.410
You're lucky that didn't go on much longer.
I hear rabbits eat their own poop.

07:58.410 --> 08:00.120
Like I'd ever do that!

08:00.120 --> 08:02.330
Ugh, I knew I shouldn't have played.

08:02.330 --> 08:05.250
You'll eventually see how fun this can be.

08:08.000 --> 08:09.160
Two.

08:11.120 --> 08:14.750
Player, name all the three-digit prime numbers.

08:14.750 --> 08:16.000
What?!

08:16.000 --> 08:18.290
What's wrong? Giving up already?

08:20.330 --> 08:23.870
101, 103, 107...

08:23.870 --> 08:27.040
...109, 111...

08:27.040 --> 08:29.120
A mistake.

08:29.120 --> 08:30.910
Guess you'll have to start over.

08:30.910 --> 08:37.250
Curse you... 101, 103, 107, 109...

08:35.040 --> 08:37.250
How terrifying

08:37.250 --> 08:40.950
Wait, what are prime numbers again?
...113, 127...

08:41.750 --> 08:43.370
What to do...

08:43.370 --> 08:46.870
I'm not very good at cooking.

08:46.870 --> 08:48.450
Leave it all to me!

08:52.750 --> 08:54.580
And there you have it.

08:55.910 --> 08:57.120
Go!

09:08.790 --> 09:10.370
That's so rock!

09:30.250 --> 09:32.200
This one seems good.

09:32.200 --> 09:34.330
It seems thick and sturdy.

09:34.330 --> 09:36.080
Then let's go ahead and mark them.

09:44.000 --> 09:46.830
Now, let's have a look inside...

09:53.120 --> 09:55.290
This isn't too bad.

09:56.540 --> 09:58.120
It's lovely!

09:58.120 --> 10:00.080
It looks nice in here, too.

10:00.080 --> 10:03.950
But I appear to be weary from the rough trail...

10:03.950 --> 10:07.700
Are you okay? Want me to do
something nice for you?

10:07.700 --> 10:11.620
Oh, no. I couldn't possibly ask for someone
to coddle me other than my sisters.

10:11.620 --> 10:12.750
Oh!

10:19.620 --> 10:21.370
What in the world are you doing?

10:21.370 --> 10:23.540
Would you like to join in, Emilia?

10:23.540 --> 10:25.540
This is Cabaret on the go!

10:25.540 --> 10:27.000
I'm not interested.

10:28.870 --> 10:30.160
It's so pretty.

10:30.160 --> 10:32.250
That looks delicious!

10:32.250 --> 10:34.120
You think so?

10:34.120 --> 10:35.580
Lemme see.

10:41.620 --> 10:43.700
Yeah, it's definitely poisonous.

10:43.700 --> 10:45.200
You'll die if you eat it.

10:45.200 --> 10:46.660
Are you okay?!

10:46.660 --> 10:48.080
I'm fine.

10:48.080 --> 10:49.950
You're awesome!

10:49.950 --> 10:51.750
Even if these mushrooms won't work...

10:56.950 --> 10:58.080
Salsa-san!

10:58.790 --> 11:00.500
What happened?!

11:03.500 --> 11:05.120
Leave it to me!

11:06.870 --> 11:08.250
Hiyah!

11:12.160 --> 11:13.620
Wow—

11:18.700 --> 11:21.200
Okay! I'll try that, too!

11:27.700 --> 11:29.370
What a haul!

11:36.450 --> 11:37.660
Mary-san!

11:37.660 --> 11:39.700
Are you all right?

11:39.700 --> 11:41.660
That looked like it hurt...

12:09.120 --> 12:10.370
Oh?

12:20.370 --> 12:23.080
Perhaps I should've made you our dinner.

12:31.290 --> 12:32.580
What?

12:34.370 --> 12:36.660
What is this?

12:57.370 --> 12:59.040
Huh? Emilia?

13:00.500 --> 13:02.080
What's wrong?

13:02.080 --> 13:07.410
Did you want me to do
something nice... after... all?

13:33.700 --> 13:36.750
You okay, Champe?

13:36.750 --> 13:41.620
Thanks... I'm feeling better, I think.

13:41.620 --> 13:45.600
Why'd you suggest a lottery?
You know how Mary is.

13:46.620 --> 13:48.250
And that's exactly why I did it.

13:49.200 --> 13:51.870
I was hoping this would help with her shyness.

13:51.870 --> 13:55.580
Ah... I get it now.

13:55.580 --> 13:58.950
Though I wasn't expecting her
board to malfunction.

14:00.580 --> 14:05.750
Oh, Grandmother. What big ears
and sharp fangs you have.

14:05.750 --> 14:07.500
You almost seem like a wolf...

14:07.500 --> 14:09.660
Lynette...?
I see... You must be sick.

14:09.660 --> 14:12.500
Then I'll have the cake and wine.

14:13.660 --> 14:14.660
Here I go.

14:16.290 --> 14:17.540
Five.

14:20.830 --> 14:23.250
Your partner will lose ten years.

14:23.250 --> 14:24.660
Lose ten years?

14:27.870 --> 14:30.000
I wuv you, Tia!

14:30.000 --> 14:32.160
Rosetta turned into Lolitta...
Oh, Rose.

14:32.160 --> 14:34.040
Things are getting fun.

14:34.040 --> 14:35.870
How?!

14:35.870 --> 14:39.000
Oh, you look delicious, too, Grandmother...

14:41.790 --> 14:43.160
Lynette?!

14:44.790 --> 14:47.700
Huh? Wait, what was I doing?

14:47.700 --> 14:49.250
Here I go!

14:49.250 --> 14:50.870
There, there.

14:49.960 --> 14:50.870
One.

14:51.950 --> 14:54.250
Tag team a song and dance!

14:54.250 --> 14:55.290
What?!

14:55.290 --> 14:59.040
Damn it... Fine. We're singing, Angelica.

14:59.040 --> 15:00.830
Wait, seriously?!

15:00.830 --> 15:02.160
Can you sing?

15:02.160 --> 15:04.200
You shouldn't push yourselves too much...

15:04.200 --> 15:07.040
What?! Who do you think I am?

15:07.040 --> 15:10.410
I'll let you have the honour of
hearing the best song ever.

15:12.870 --> 15:14.580
Gimme candy, let's go!

15:15.500 --> 15:17.540
Hello, hello!

15:17.540 --> 15:19.120
The two of us are...

15:19.120 --> 15:21.830
...Sadistic Candy!

15:21.830 --> 15:24.830
I hope you all have an angelic time!

15:26.620 --> 15:27.910
What a weird old lady.

15:27.910 --> 15:29.870
Who're you callin' old, huh?!

15:29.870 --> 15:31.280
Let's get singing already.

15:31.280 --> 15:36.550
yume no naka de machiawase

15:31.280 --> 15:36.550
Let's rendezvous in the middle of a dream

15:36.550 --> 15:44.790
kimi to futari de iku yo! dreaming wonderland!

15:36.550 --> 15:44.790
! dreaming wonderland!

15:36.550 --> 15:44.790
I'm coming with you! dreaming wonderland!

15:53.690 --> 15:56.490
hyappiki me no hitsuji door wo hataite

15:53.690 --> 15:56.490
Knocking on the door of the 100th sheep

15:56.490 --> 15:58.970
yume no sekai e totsunyu da!

15:56.490 --> 15:58.970
Entering the world of the dream!

15:58.970 --> 16:01.600
ah kirakira ticket wo te ni irete

15:58.970 --> 16:01.600
Ah, I've got my shiny ticket

16:01.600 --> 16:04.240
te wo tsunaide passing gate!

16:01.600 --> 16:04.240
passing gate!

16:01.600 --> 16:04.240
Hand in hand, passing gate!

16:04.240 --> 16:11.820
youkoso koko wa ne kizutsukanai sekai da

16:04.240 --> 16:11.820
Welcome to a world where nothing can hurt you

16:11.820 --> 16:15.120
saa nani mo kamo zenbu wasurete

16:11.820 --> 16:15.120
Forget everything and everyone

16:15.120 --> 16:17.760
pierrot to uma ni notte

16:15.120 --> 16:17.760
On a horse with a clown

16:17.760 --> 16:20.400
guru guru mawarou yo! so good!

16:17.760 --> 16:20.400
! so good!

16:17.760 --> 16:20.400
We'll go round and round and round! So good!

16:20.400 --> 16:23.030
nandemo dekichau kibun da

16:20.400 --> 16:23.030
I feel like I can do anything

16:23.030 --> 16:25.670
hocus! pocus! saikyou juumon da

16:23.030 --> 16:25.670
hocus! pocus!

16:23.030 --> 16:25.670
Hocus! Pocus! The strongest spell

16:25.670 --> 16:28.310
isseno de issho ni tobikome

16:25.670 --> 16:28.310
Come on, jump with me!

16:28.310 --> 16:30.620
positive★paradise

16:28.310 --> 16:30.620
Positive★paradise

16:30.620 --> 16:33.580
nantoka naru jan shinpai nai jan

16:30.620 --> 16:33.580
It's gonna be all right, don't worry

16:33.580 --> 16:36.220
hocus! pocus! zettai muteki da

16:33.580 --> 16:36.220
Hocus! Pocus! I'm invincible!

16:36.220 --> 16:42.810
welcome youkoso dreaming wonderland!

16:36.220 --> 16:42.810
welcome  dreaming wonderland!

16:36.220 --> 16:42.810
Welcome to dreaming wonderland!

16:51.710 --> 16:53.690
miracle power!

16:51.710 --> 16:53.690
Miracle power!

16:54.830 --> 16:56.660
You two are amazing!

16:56.660 --> 16:58.080
I'm shocked.

16:58.080 --> 17:00.040
I wish I could hear more.

17:00.040 --> 17:02.250
Thanks, everyone!

17:02.250 --> 17:04.830
This is how it goes when I actually try.

17:04.830 --> 17:06.620
You're really good, old lady.

17:06.620 --> 17:09.200
Again, who the hell are you calling old?!

17:10.660 --> 17:13.500
We sang, we ate... This is the life.

17:13.500 --> 17:17.910
At this rate, our next Orchestra will be a hit!

17:17.910 --> 17:20.410
You should be in our next one, too, Mary.

17:21.660 --> 17:24.290
You already know
the choreography, don't you?

17:24.290 --> 17:27.040
Now, you just need to practice.

17:27.040 --> 17:28.540
But...

17:28.540 --> 17:31.870
I'll probably just mess up
and cause you two trouble.

17:31.870 --> 17:35.370
Hey, I mess up all the time.

17:35.370 --> 17:38.580
No one would laugh at your hard work.

17:38.580 --> 17:39.870
But...

17:42.160 --> 17:43.910
I guess we can turn in for the night.

17:43.910 --> 17:46.450
Let us know whenever you're ready.

17:47.290 --> 17:48.700
'Kay...

17:52.080 --> 17:54.790
Oh, I'm not a mackerel...

17:58.700 --> 18:00.870
You okay... there?

18:05.580 --> 18:06.790
Six.

18:08.160 --> 18:09.540
Blank.

18:09.540 --> 18:12.910
I'm safe... but...

18:12.910 --> 18:14.000
Ashley!

18:14.000 --> 18:16.330
Th-The rest is up to y—

18:17.910 --> 18:20.540
Looks like another one dropped out.

18:20.540 --> 18:25.370
But if I roll more than a four,
I'll make it to the goal!

18:25.370 --> 18:26.830
True.

18:26.830 --> 18:28.040
Here I go.

18:28.040 --> 18:29.580
Be careful.

18:29.580 --> 18:30.620
Go!

18:31.700 --> 18:33.700
Two.

18:33.700 --> 18:36.410
Your partner will do a thousand push-ups.

18:36.410 --> 18:38.200
Push-ups?
I'm sorry!

18:38.200 --> 18:41.620
Don't worry about it!
We've basically won our next turn!

18:41.620 --> 18:44.290
I'll do a thousand or even 10,000!

18:44.290 --> 18:45.540
Then do 10,000.

18:45.540 --> 18:51.290
I was kidding! Wait, why did you respond?

18:51.290 --> 18:53.410
One, two, three...

18:53.410 --> 18:54.790
So close yet so far.

18:54.790 --> 18:58.410
Yes, but if you roll anything other than
a six, I get another turn, and—

18:58.410 --> 19:00.200
Say no more.

19:00.200 --> 19:02.330
You never know what could happen.

19:02.330 --> 19:03.370
Huh?

19:04.540 --> 19:05.320
Three.

19:05.320 --> 19:06.000
Yes!

19:06.000 --> 19:10.120
Lucky chance! You get another roll.

19:10.120 --> 19:11.830
No way...

19:11.830 --> 19:14.790
Games aren't always fair, you know.

19:20.660 --> 19:21.950
Five.

19:26.250 --> 19:30.580
Goal! Congratulations!

19:33.120 --> 19:34.950
Two hundred and...

19:36.330 --> 19:38.250
We lost...

19:38.250 --> 19:39.540
You were so close.

19:41.790 --> 19:47.700
That was pretty fun.
If you still insist on having this map...

19:47.700 --> 19:50.040
Huh? You'll give it to us?

19:50.040 --> 19:51.540
One more round.

19:56.000 --> 19:57.910
Today was a lot of fun.

19:57.910 --> 20:00.120
Today was rockin'!

20:00.120 --> 20:03.540
We didn't come here to play, you know.

20:03.540 --> 20:05.910
We'll have to start surveying
the area tomorrow.

20:05.910 --> 20:08.330
Okay! Let's do this thing!

20:09.450 --> 20:11.450
Emilia, is something wrong?

20:11.450 --> 20:14.620
Huh? No, I'm fine.

20:14.620 --> 20:16.950
My lady, could it be...

20:18.000 --> 20:20.910
Rather than holding it in,
you should go relieve yourself outside.

20:20.910 --> 20:22.870
What are you talking about?!

20:22.870 --> 20:26.290
Apparently, supernatural phenomena
occur around here.

20:26.290 --> 20:28.910
Wh-What about that?

20:28.910 --> 20:32.040
Perhaps something will happen tonight.

20:32.040 --> 20:34.000
Wh-Wh-Wh-What are you talking about?!
Really?!

20:34.000 --> 20:36.540
Stop being ridiculous and go to sleep.

20:38.160 --> 20:40.370
Today was rather unfortunate.

20:40.370 --> 20:42.750
Should we try again tomorrow?

20:42.750 --> 20:45.290
Sorry, but I don't think I'll last.

20:45.290 --> 20:47.540
Me, neither...

20:47.540 --> 20:50.870
I think we might have to give up.

20:50.870 --> 20:53.370
Yeah, you're right...

20:51.980 --> 20:53.370
Hey, I got the map!

20:53.370 --> 20:54.310
What?!

20:54.310 --> 20:55.250
That's amazing!

20:55.250 --> 20:56.370
Well done!

20:56.370 --> 20:59.750
I'm surprised Lucifer-san let you have it.

20:59.750 --> 21:01.830
Nah, I just got it from the director.

21:01.830 --> 21:03.040
Of course!

21:03.040 --> 21:05.250
Well done getting it from her!

21:05.250 --> 21:06.570
Actually, I...

21:06.570 --> 21:08.040
We should get ready immediately!

21:08.040 --> 21:10.950
Let's get some sleep and leave before sunrise!

21:10.950 --> 21:12.290
Ehh?!

21:12.290 --> 21:14.830
I don't wanna go early in the morning.

21:14.830 --> 21:17.370
We don't have time to complain about that.

21:17.370 --> 21:19.870
I'll smack you awake if I have to.

21:19.870 --> 21:21.330
Aw...

22:20.880 --> 22:30.780
mado no soto wa yasashii tsukiakari sotto

22:20.880 --> 22:30.780
Outside the window, the gentle moonlight is shining softly

22:30.780 --> 22:39.480
akari keshite yume no hashi wo watarou

22:30.780 --> 22:39.480
Put out the lights and cross the bridge of dreams

22:39.480 --> 22:44.280
kie soude kienai hikari ga ima

22:39.480 --> 22:44.280
The weakening yet everlasting light is now

22:44.280 --> 22:49.080
mabuta no mukou no sekai ni hirogatta

22:44.280 --> 22:49.080
Spreading out into the world behind my eyelids

22:49.080 --> 22:51.780
ironna omoi ga afurete

22:49.080 --> 22:51.780
Various feelings are overflowing

22:51.780 --> 22:55.530
kirakira mabushiku kagayaiteru

22:51.780 --> 22:55.530
sparklingly and dazzlingly shining

22:55.530 --> 22:58.680
zutto

22:55.530 --> 22:58.680
Forever

22:58.680 --> 23:00.780
It's shining stars

23:00.780 --> 23:05.580
ashita wa donna hi ni naru kana

23:00.780 --> 23:05.580
I wonder what kind of day tomorrow will be

23:05.580 --> 23:10.680
kokoro ni utsushidasu keshiki wa

23:05.580 --> 23:10.680
The scenery that is reflected in my heart

23:10.680 --> 23:15.630
kitai namida yume no zenbu ga kasanatta

23:10.680 --> 23:15.630
Expectations, tears, and dreams, all of it bottled up in my heart

23:15.630 --> 23:19.230
watashi no planetarium

23:15.630 --> 23:19.230
My planetarium

23:19.230 --> 23:19.980
hora

23:19.230 --> 23:25.080
Look, in that star that is shining the brightest

23:19.980 --> 23:25.080
ichiban kagayaiteiru ano hoshi ni

23:25.080 --> 23:29.280
negai kakete oyasumi

23:25.080 --> 23:29.280
A wish is enclosed: "Good night"
